WEBVTT

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.609
A red gauna.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.287
No...

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:38.747
The Crimson Hawk Moth.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:46.046
I didn't know it was still alive.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.094
Crimson Hawk Moth.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.359
Tanikaze! Go to Izana!

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:08.360
Hurry!

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:31.174
Tsumugi!

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.342
<i>Do not worry.</i>

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.595
<i>Tsumugi can handle
<i>the Crimson Hawk Moth.</i></i>

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:38.098
<i>Please, do not waste any more time.</i>

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.100
But...

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:47.858
Tanikaze!

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:50.819
Okay.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.299
Good.

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:14.968
I always believed...

00:02:15.344 --> 00:02:18.180
that I would be the one to destroy you.

00:02:48.043 --> 00:02:52.547
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:02:56.551 --> 00:03:01.848
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:02.641 --> 00:03:08.605
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:09.356 --> 00:03:12.776
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:22.702
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:03:22.786 --> 00:03:25.789
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:29.042
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:31.461
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:03:31.795 --> 00:03:37.217
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:42.055
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:44.266 --> 00:03:50.188
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:03:50.939 --> 00:03:56.903
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:03:56.987 --> 00:04:00.532
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:03.034
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:04:03.827 --> 00:04:06.997
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.501
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.428
ENCOUNTER

00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:51.124
Don't you think
it's safer not to walk too far?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.669
I want to get the lay of the land.

00:04:54.753 --> 00:04:58.215
And this is safer
than staying around our gardes.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.258
They draw too much attention.

00:05:05.263 --> 00:05:08.433
Wow, this is amazing.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:18.568
I always dreamed about exploring
an unknown planet when I was a kid.

00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:22.405
Is that so...

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:28.703
Whoa!

00:06:56.916 --> 00:07:00.003
Make it perfectly clear...

00:07:00.712 --> 00:07:02.505
who the superior life form is.

00:07:21.775 --> 00:07:24.402
I'm sorry, Captain.

00:07:24.527 --> 00:07:27.322
I thought that getting rid
of our weapons and fuel

00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:30.575
would get them off our trail.

00:07:32.702 --> 00:07:36.414
No. That's not a gauna
that was chasing us,

00:07:36.748 --> 00:07:39.960
it was already here.

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:43.338
If I hadn't stumbled so close to it,

00:07:43.546 --> 00:07:45.590
it wouldn't have even known
we were here.

00:07:47.008 --> 00:07:50.387
So, I'm the one
that needs to apologize.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:54.724
SELF-DESTRUCT

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:56.893
What are you doing?!

00:07:57.602 --> 00:07:59.396
Just setting up my insurance.

00:07:59.813 --> 00:08:02.357
There's no way
I'm letting it eat me alive.

00:08:07.529 --> 00:08:09.239
It's coming towards us! Let's run!

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.368
It's useless.
I'm sure the others are coming, too.

00:08:13.576 --> 00:08:16.538
It's over. There's nowhere to run.

00:08:16.705 --> 00:08:18.456
Please, stand up!

00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:22.252
Captain, hurry!

00:08:38.768 --> 00:08:39.978
This way.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.231
Nagate!

00:09:25.482 --> 00:09:26.900
Izana!

00:09:38.161 --> 00:09:38.995
Get in!

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:41.331
Are you hurt?

00:09:42.457 --> 00:09:44.167
We're okay!

00:09:58.515 --> 00:10:00.350
We can't stay here.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.363
Tanikaze, come in! Tanikaze!

00:10:13.655 --> 00:10:16.032
We've reestablished connection
with Unit Tanikaze!

00:10:16.116 --> 00:10:17.951
<i>I've secured the survivors!</i>

00:10:19.077 --> 00:10:21.496
<i>Subcommander Midorikawa,
<i>what's Tsumugi's status?</i></i>

00:10:21.579 --> 00:10:22.497
She is safe.

00:10:24.874 --> 00:10:26.709
<i>This is Hybrid Tsumugi.</i>

00:10:27.377 --> 00:10:31.172
We are currently engaged with the Crimson
Hawk Moth. We will end this soon.

00:10:37.345 --> 00:10:39.681
<i>Tanikaze! Join up with Tsumugi!</i>

00:10:39.806 --> 00:10:40.807
Copy that!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.687
HIGH CONCENTRATION
OF HEIGUS PARTICLES DETECTED

00:11:26.352 --> 00:11:27.854
We're surrounded!

00:11:36.404 --> 00:11:38.573
He's anchored the garde?

00:11:38.656 --> 00:11:40.700
Is he going to face all of those gauna?

00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:43.536
LEG LOCKS ENGAGED
GAUNA CORE-PIERCING ROUNDS

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:46.664
GAUNA PROJECTED CORE POSITIONS
FRONT COUNTLESS

00:11:47.373 --> 00:11:48.917
<i>Anchoring should allow me</i>

00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:51.502
<i>to keep my aim steady.</i>

00:12:01.471 --> 00:12:03.348
Can anybody tell me Tanikaze's status?

00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:06.392
Multiple gaunas detected
around the crash site,

00:12:06.559 --> 00:12:09.646
but the gas clouds are disrupting
our communication signals!

00:12:46.432 --> 00:12:47.934
AMMO DEPLETED - WARNING

00:12:48.184 --> 00:12:49.519
<i>I'm out of ammo!</i>

00:12:49.894 --> 00:12:50.937
LEG LOCKS ENGAGED
RELEASE LOCKS

00:12:59.862 --> 00:13:01.823
Three left...

00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:08.746
MAN-MADE KABI BLADE ARMED

00:13:40.236 --> 00:13:42.613
CORE EXPOSED

00:14:03.259 --> 00:14:04.969
What is that weapon?!

00:14:05.053 --> 00:14:07.388
He sliced those gauna in half,
core and all.

00:14:08.431 --> 00:14:10.516
Wow...

00:14:28.576 --> 00:14:34.415
SITES OF SIDONIA
FLOOR 4271 SHOPPING DISTRICT

00:14:34.999 --> 00:14:38.711
We've established communication
with Tanikaze! He's alive!

00:14:40.963 --> 00:14:44.258
New gauna detected
above the gas clouds!

00:14:45.259 --> 00:14:46.094
Tanikaze,

00:14:46.427 --> 00:14:49.639
eliminate the gauna blocking your course
and join up with Tsumugi!

00:14:49.806 --> 00:14:50.765
<i>Copy that!</i>

00:14:52.141 --> 00:14:56.145
It seems the anti-gauna blade
was dulled significantly

00:14:56.229 --> 00:14:58.439
after cutting the first gauna.

00:14:59.899 --> 00:15:03.486
It's fine. We can improve it.

00:15:06.447 --> 00:15:07.949
Tsumugi...

00:16:10.344 --> 00:16:11.762
I'm sorry.

00:16:12.555 --> 00:16:15.766
I meant to destroy all of your ena first.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.941
Now, with this...

00:16:24.192 --> 00:16:28.321
I shall end your suffering.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.097
Tsumugi!
Get away from the Crimson Hawk Moth!

00:16:55.264 --> 00:16:57.433
It's draining your Heigus particles!

00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:14.325
TSUMUGI: UNSTABLE
HEIGUS PARTICLE CONCENTRATION

00:17:14.867 --> 00:17:18.037
Tsumugi's Heigus particle
concentration is dropping fast.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.457
Tsumugi! Get away!

00:17:23.417 --> 00:17:25.836
Crimson Hawk Moth's Heigus
concentration is increasing rapidly!

00:17:25.962 --> 00:17:28.339
Tsumugi!
You have to get away from it!

00:18:03.249 --> 00:18:04.750
What is this?

00:18:04.834 --> 00:18:08.879
This particle count is three times higher
than what Tsumugi originally had!

00:18:09.297 --> 00:18:11.007
How is that possible?

00:18:53.841 --> 00:18:55.926
Multiple projectiles
have penetrated Tsumugi!

00:18:56.052 --> 00:18:59.972
Her outer shell is being consumed
by the ena. Her internals are...

00:19:00.806 --> 00:19:03.351
Crimson Hawk Moth
has unleashed a second attack!

00:19:03.517 --> 00:19:06.062
Five... six more projectiles
have penetrated Tsumugi!

00:19:06.312 --> 00:19:09.273
Tsumugi's Heigus concentration
is dropping at an increased rate!

00:19:09.357 --> 00:19:12.652
She's in danger of dropping
below the minimum operational needs!

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:30.378
Now, with this...

00:19:30.878 --> 00:19:32.630
I shall end your suffering.

00:19:45.768 --> 00:19:47.019
Tsumugi!

00:19:52.817 --> 00:19:54.944
Unit Tanikaze has engaged
the Crimson Hawk Moth.

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:56.362
Tanikaze!

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:12.294
HIGH CONCENTRATION OF HEIGUS
PARTICLES DETECTED - DANGER WARNING

00:20:15.756 --> 00:20:16.799
VISUAL SIGNAL DETECTION MALFUNCTION

00:20:21.303 --> 00:20:22.888
LIVE: NAGATE TANIKAZE

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:26.642
Direct Heigus cannon hits to Unit
Tanikaze. Severe damage to head sector.

00:20:30.312 --> 00:20:31.897
The frame sustained no damage,

00:20:31.981 --> 00:20:34.483
but the internal cranial structure
was completely destroyed.

00:20:35.234 --> 00:20:39.029
So, are you saying it knew that opening
was its only weakness?

00:20:49.498 --> 00:20:50.875
SWITCH TO MANUAL TARGETING
MAN-MADE KABI BLADE

00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:52.042
NO HIGH HEIGUS CONCENTRATION
DETECTED

00:20:52.126 --> 00:20:53.377
PROJECTED ARRIVAL TRAJECTORY
TARGET LOST

00:20:56.297 --> 00:20:57.798
Where is it?

00:21:23.866 --> 00:21:24.867
<i>Tanikaze!</i>

00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:27.119
<i>The ena is infiltrating your interior!</i>

00:21:27.578 --> 00:21:28.829
Damn it!

00:21:50.267 --> 00:21:51.519
EMERGENCY CHEST MISSILE
STANDBY

00:21:51.644 --> 00:21:52.895
FIRE LEFT CHEST MISSILE

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.230
READY TO FIRE

00:22:14.875 --> 00:22:16.126
What?

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:17.461
HIGH CONCENTRATION OF
HEIGUS PARTICLES DETECTED

00:22:40.901 --> 00:22:42.486
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.907 --> 00:22:50.869
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.953 --> 00:22:54.623
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.707 --> 00:22:59.795
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:05.718
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.801 --> 00:23:09.388
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.471 --> 00:23:15.394
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.477 --> 00:23:17.813
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.896 --> 00:23:19.898
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.982 --> 00:23:22.901
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.985 --> 00:23:25.279
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.362 --> 00:23:27.197
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.281 --> 00:23:30.618
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.201 --> 00:23:32.703
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:36.415
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.498 --> 00:23:40.127
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:43.839
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.922 --> 00:23:47.593
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.676 --> 00:23:51.263
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.347 --> 00:23:54.892
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.975 --> 00:23:59.313
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.396 --> 00:24:05.986
<i>As I walk this path</i>
